            "heading": "What's the last day to order for Christmas delivery?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>To have your book arrive by Christmas, order by these dates:</p><ul><li><strong>USA:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>Standard: Thursday, December 10</li><li>Expedited: Wednesday, December 16</li></ol><ul><li><strong>Canada:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>Standard: Tuesday, December 8</li><li>Expedited: Monday, December 14</li></ol><ul><li><strong>Europe:</strong> Tuesday, December 8</li><li><strong>Australia:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>NSW, QLD & VIC (metro): Wednesday, December 16</li><li>SA & ACT (metro): Tuesday, December 15</li><li>WA (metro): Saturday, December 12</li><li>TAS (metro): Sunday, December 13</li><li>NT (metro): Thursday, December 10</li><li>All regional/major cities: Order by Thursday, December 10 to be safe</li></ol><ul><li><strong>UK:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>Standard: Monday, December 14</li><li>Express: Tuesday, December 15</li></ol><ul><li><strong>Rest of the world:</strong> Order as early as you can</li></ul><p>Delivery times can change for reasons outside our control, so we can't guarantee arrival by Christmas. Ordering early gives your book the best chance.</p>",
