    "custom_liquid_RpHwFi": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .pp-c{--ink:#121212;--mut:rgba(18,18,18,.6);--body:rgba(18,18,18,.75);--line:#eadfce;font-family:Assistant,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--body);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px;align-items:stretch}\n  .pp-c *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .pp-c-card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px 26px 22px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(60,40,10,.05);display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n  .pp-c-qm{position:absolute;top:2px;left:18px;font:400 64px/1 Assistant,sans-serif;color:#f6d9cf}\n  .pp-c-card h3{font-family:inherit;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;margin:14px 0 10px;position:relative;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.6px}\n  .pp-c-card p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}\n  .pp-c-card footer{margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;align-items:baseline;font-size:14px}\n  .pp-c-card footer strong{color:var(--ink)}\n  .pp-c-card footer span{color:var(--mut)}\n  @media(max-width:749px){.pp-c{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .pp-c-wrap{width:100%;max-width:762px;margin:0 auto}\n  .pp-c [hidden]{display:none!important}\n  .pp-c-chip{margin-left:auto;background:#e6f2ec;color:#2d6a4f;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}\n  .pp-c-more{text-align:center;margin-top:28px}\n  .pp-c-more button{display:inline-block;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer;background:#121212;color:#fff;font-family:Assistant,sans-serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:15px;line-height:47px;padding:0 30px}\n  .pp-c-more button:hover{background:#333}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"pp-c-wrap\">\n<div class=\"pp-c\">\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card\">\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>A gift to treasure</h3>\n    <p>I was gifted this book from my grandparents with my baby's name on it and I absolutely love it! It's by far my favorite book I've received and I know my baby is going to love it just as much as me.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Shekinah Amos</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card\">\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Instantly loved</h3>\n    <p>This book is absolutely beautiful. I am obsessed with it. I teared up the first time I read it!! The illustrations are stunning too!! Such a good book to have for your children!!!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Allee</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card\">\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Beautiful quality</h3>\n    <p>I received my books today and I was absolutely blown away by just how beautiful they are! The quality is amazing!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Lauren Taylor</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>My two High School graduates LOVE this book</h3>\n    <p>I love to give children's beautifully illustrated books to people for many occasions. I happened to find this one as I was searching for the perfect sentiment for my daughter and her best friend as they graduated from high school last week. &quot;I Wish You Happiness&quot; was the perfect find in both the beautiful, sweet, colorful illustrations and the words, which are so fitting for any transition, which in this case is sending them off to college. The author said everything I wished for them and yes, a few tears were shed.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Susan</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>The PERFECT Gift!</h3>\n    <p>I was looking for a book to gift to my son for his high school graduation-granted he just finished Kindergarten but I plan on having his teachers write a little something in the book each year and gift the final book to him as a surprise when he graduates his senior year. This book embodies what we are teaching him and what we hope he carries throughout his life - we wish him happiness! The book itself is absolutely amazing - the illustrations are beautiful which match the words throughout the book&hellip;the PERFECT gift!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Rosie</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>A Gorgeous Book with a Gorgeous Story</h3>\n    <p>This book is such a fantastic read! Not only is the book beautifully written, but the illustrations capture the love and adoration wrapped within the text. Any parent reading this to their child just might tear up at how touching this book is.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Melquea Smith</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Breathtakingly beautiful!!</h3>\n    <p>This book completely captivated my three youngest children, all boys ages 2, 4 &amp; 8. They LOVED the sweet words and message of the book.</p>\n    <p>We read the book aloud and took our time turning the pages. The details and the artwork are truly unbelievable. I found myself after several minutes encouraging a page-turn as they could have stared at each page for hours. Such a good buy and a keepsake for our collection!! HIGHLY recommend!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Katie Weaver</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Absolutely beautiful</h3>\n    <p>Where do I begin! This is just my absolute favourite book at the moment. I love everything about it! The beautiful writing with the magical illustrations have created a masterpiece. A book to be treasured young and old!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Chandni</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>I wish you happiness</h3>\n    <p>I love this book, the colours and characters are truly beautiful. I purchased it to read to my twin granddaughters, as I want them both to believe in themselves, but even more importantly, I want them to be happy within themselves and I encourage all parents and grandparents to do this too.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Sherryn Chapman</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Awesome Book</h3>\n    <p>You know how you love your kids so much and you want the best for them so bad but sometimes you don't know how to put the enormity of your emotions on paper? Lol, maybe I'm the only one with this problem, but I loved that this book helped me put to words the wealth of emotion and good vibes I feel for my kids. This is an awesome awesome book and my kids loved it.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Jennifer Aire</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Heartwarming and Captivating Children's Book, I Wish You Happiness</h3>\n    <p>This book is beautifully illustrated with a storyline that is amazing. I cannot express adequately how much I loved giving this as a gift to our great granddaughter. She has an extensive library of children's books. Without a doubt, this is one of her favorites and mine. To read this together is heartwarming. I highly recommend this book as a lasting gift to give to any child in your life.</p>\n    <footer><strong>D. Hetzer</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>An absolutely beautiful book</h3>\n    <p>What a beautiful book. Not only are the words heartfelt, but the illustrations are just stunning. This book is a classic and will be cherished for years to come. Michael also has amazing customer service. I received an email the minute I ordered (which was 10pm at night hehe) and also when the book was posted and once more to check it arrived. Thank you so much Michael!</p>\n    <footer><strong>Sarah Cullen</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Amazing Gift!!</h3>\n    <p>I have been giving the personalized hardcover books to my friends when they have children and what an incredible gift and experience it has been! They have all loved it not only because they are great inclusive books but for a child and their parents to see their name in a book makes them feel special. Also Michael was fantastic about doing some custom names for me that were not on the list which were printed and shipped very quickly. Michael was super helpful and communicated all the steps along the way.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Ryan G</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span><span class=\"pp-c-chip\">Personalized</span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Very special, every home should have one!</h3>\n    <p>Dear Michael, thank you so very much for your gorgeous book. If my youngest granddaughter loves it as much as her older sister I may have to get another one! The delivery was prompt and hassle free, your email contact is lovely, and the packaging and presentation on arrival was just beautiful. Thank you for sharing your talent, your words are meaningful and inspirational. It truly is a book that every child should have.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Lorraine Robbie</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"pp-c-card pp-c-extra\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pp-c-qm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n    <h3>Just beautiful</h3>\n    <p>This book is a masterpiece. I want to frame the illustrations and put them on my walls. The words are tender and beautiful too - you can use them. In cards you give to friends and family. Wonderful wishes.</p>\n    <footer><strong>Diana A</strong><span>on <em>I Wish You Happiness</em></span></footer>\n  </article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pp-c-more\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">More</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function(){\n    var wrap=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;\n    var btn=wrap.querySelector('.pp-c-more button');\n    btn.addEventListener('click',function(){\n      wrap.querySelectorAll('.pp-c-extra').forEach(function(c){c.hidden=false;});\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');\n      btn.parentNode.hidden=true;\n    });\n  })();\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
