          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Picco Puppy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Picco Puppy is an indie children's picture book publisher founded by award-winning author Michael Wong. Since 2020, our books have delighted over 450,000 customers worldwide and earned over 3,000 five-star ratings on Amazon.</p><p>Based in Sydney, Australia (ABN 22 143 805 207), Picco Puppy partners with printers in the US, UK, the Netherlands, and Australia. Your book prints close to home, which means faster and more affordable shipping and support for local businesses along the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
